      "content": "hey so i'm on ritalin for adhd and finals week is coming up and i'm like really struggling to stay locked in. i was thinking about maybe adding some extra caffeine or like a couple of those high dose caffeine pills to help me focus even more... u think that's a good idea for extra boost??",
