      "content": "i know you're saying sleep is good but i literally dont have time for that right now lol. if i just take the caffeine right when the ritalin starts wearing off in the afternoon, won't that just smooth out the crash? i'm thinking of doing like 3 or 4 of those 200mg pills throughout the day just to keep the momentum going. it should be fine as long as i don't feel my heart racing, right?",
